sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Author
  participant DMS as Document system
  participant Reviewer
  participant QA as Quality assurance
  Author->>DMS: Upload draft SOP rev. C
  DMS->>Reviewer: Review task
  activate Reviewer
  Reviewer-->>DMS: Comments
  deactivate Reviewer
  loop Until no comments remain
    Author->>DMS: Revised draft
    DMS->>Reviewer: Review task
  end
  rect rgb(235, 242, 250)
    DMS->>QA: Approval request
    alt Approved
      QA-->>DMS: Electronic signature
      DMS-)Author: Effective in 14 days
    else Rejected
      QA-->>DMS: Reason
    end
  end
  Note over Author,QA: Training records are created when the SOP becomes effective
